          "question": "The train left before I reached the station.",
          "direction": "In each of the following sentences, a part of the sentence has been bold. Below are given alternatives to the bold part which may improve the sentence. Choose the correct alternative. Wherever no improvement is needed, choose ‘No replacement required’ as the answer.",
