          "explanation": "Sol. Let present age of Manish = x ⇒ Present age of Amit = 1.5x Manish’s age five years ago = x – 5 Amit’s age five years ago = 2(x−5) = 2x – 10 66 But Amit’s age five years ago also equals to (1.5x – 5) ⇒ 2x – 10 = 1.5x – 5 ⇒ 0.5x = 5 ⇒ x = 10 Lalit’s age five years hence = 10 + 5 + 1.5 × 10 + 5 = 15 + 15 + 5 = 35 Lalit’s present age = 35 – 5 = 30",
